## Daily worklog (every project, every session)
Keep a WORKLOG.md in the project's repo under joaoguilherme-ops. This is a recurring daily duty, not a one-off. Follow the `project-worklog` skill: read it at the start of each session, update it after each block of work and at the end of the day.
- Claude Code: use the `project-worklog` skill (~/.claude/skills/project-worklog/SKILL.md).
- Cursor: read and follow ~/.cursor/skills/project-worklog/SKILL.md (if you can't open it, tell me instead of skipping the worklog).
